    "body": "Line: cross-state continuation · count 0/3 · headline 177/512 → 437/512\n\nReferences #2030.\n\n**KEEP:** the preregistered native pooled-token ranking run gains 260 complete replies, loses none, and retains all 177 saved-parent successes on the unchanged frozen 512 panel. It also retains every successful row from all 11 saved comparison models. Length8 improves 11→90/128. The development threshold of 256 is passed; fresh ≥40% qualification is NOT_RUN, so M2 remains open.\n\nTraining restores saved177's exact fractional masters and changes the token objective to softplus of the negative log target/strongest-wrong native pooled-mass ratio (margin0), retaining equal-episode logmeanexp aggregation. Only the existing 115,200 Q4 cross-state coefficients learn. Native scorer, aliases, clip, decoder, grader and upstream model stay fixed. The sole endpoint follows256 updates/four full-panel passes with fresh Adam, lineage832→1088. No serving kernel change.\n\nThe full512 pre-update baseline reproduces saved177 exactly. Saved/reloaded own-prefix evaluation and independent review of all1,024 endpoint rows agree. Entry298→507, teacher-token correctness3304→6491/6664, complete swap pairs32→186;75 complete replies still fail. All512 examples are exposed development data, with no fresh-transfer/general-chat/geometry-advantage/energy claim.\n\n**Would my next step differ if this came out the other way? Yes.** At≤177: REJECT, retain177, count1/3 and stop the unchanged rank recipe. At437: KEEP and, after delivery/cleanup, freeze fresh criteria and draw/score this saved model without further training.\n\nProducer5db7023bb:25 focused tests, optimized CUDA build, formatting/diff and independent source review PASS. Two fixture-only failed checks are preserved; neither ran the model. Final-head25 focused tests, optimized build, formatting/diff, claim wording, source/evidence checks and independent review PASS at4b62b54c1. Validation: https://github.com/UOR-Foundation/uor-r4/pull/2162#issuecomment-6098503151 . GitHub transport acknowledgements are not tests; protected queue in progress.\n\nCanonical record: docs/labs/m2-pooled-rank-2026-10-10/README.md. Current-state, README, STATUS and ROADMAP updated, preserving other labs' merged entries. Full156,825,600-byte artifact package is iCloud stream/index verified (MD5 49985949980d98d05f9c0274e5529f63), including prior parents/negative evidence. Model process757.615s, peakRSS790476KiB, sampledGPU838MiB; complete-cycle charge/merge/cleanup closeout follows on #2030. Preregistration: https://github.com/UOR-Foundation/uor-r4/issues/2030#issuecomment-6098141610\n\n",
